        </AlertDescription>
      </Alert>
      </li>
      <li>
      Remove the default storage class setting from the old default storage class.
      <p>For the old default storage class, change the value of the <code>storageclass.kubernetes.io/is-default-class</code> annotation to <code>false</code> by running the following command:</p>
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc patch storageclass gp3 -p '{\"metadata\": {\"annotations\": {\"storageclass.kubernetes.io/is-default-class\": \"false\"}}}'"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Verify the changes by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc get storageclass"} lang="terminal" />
